      "created_at": "2026-09-15",
      "text": "We are very close at this point - last month's PaperCut (printing software) hack likely exposed this much PII in the USA, and it turns out to have been carried out [using a swarm of agents](https://www.greynoise.io/blog/ai-orchestrated-campaign-against-papercut-ng-mf), albeit under direct instruction from a malicious actor. Not even frontier agents, just DeepSeek 4.",
